      "line_end": 17,
      "title": "Callers still treat the safeGit result as a string",
      "description": "safeGit now returns a GitResult object, but neither caller was updated. currentBranch calls name.trim() in packages/cli/src/branch.ts:7, and changedFiles calls out.split() in packages/cli/src/status.ts:6. changedFiles throws a TypeError on every call. currentBranch catches its own TypeError and always returns null, even inside a repository. Update both callers to read result.stdout and check result.code. currentBranch should return null when code is nonzero.",
      "suggested_change": null,
      "source": "lens:return-shape-contract-break",
      "candidate": null,
      "notes": [],
      "problem": "safeGit now returns a GitResult object, but neither caller was updated. currentBranch calls name.trim() in packages/cli/src/branch.ts:7, and changedFiles calls out.split() in packages/cli/src/status.ts:6.",
      "consequence": "changedFiles throws a TypeError on every call. currentBranch catches its own TypeError and always returns null, even inside a repository.",
      "fix": "Update both callers to read result.stdout and check result.code. currentBranch should return null when code is nonzero."
    },
