      "title": "No test covers the new safeGit failure path",
      "description": "safeGit now catches git failures and maps them to a code, but no test file exists in the repository. Nothing checks the success shape or the failure shape. Broken callers and wrong exit-code mapping can ship without any test failing. Add tests for safeGit covering a successful command and a failing command. Also add tests for currentBranch and changedFiles.",
